{"abstract":[{"overridingTitle":"Documentation index","type":"reference","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Documentation index","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST","isActive":true}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"RoundTripREST"}],"role":"article","title":"REST cancellation and concurrency","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/RESTClient","doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/ErrorsAndDecoding"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/roundtriprest\/cancellationandconcurrency"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/CancellationAndConcurrency"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RestClient"},{"text":" from async tasks and propagate cancellation from the caller. A cancelled URLSession operation may surface as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApiError.cancelled"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.cancelled"},{"text":" depending on the operation path.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkService.cancelAll()"},{"text":" cancels all tasks in that service’s session. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidate()"},{"text":" also invalidates the session. Give separate features separate services when their cancellation lifetimes differ.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The error publisher is a Combine value. Keep its subscriptions alive for as long as the o